  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Thank you for playing our demo! We are incredibly happy that we can finally
    share this project with you. Our team has been working very hard to bring you
    all a piece of Brazilian history with a queer, romantic, twist. We hope you enjoy
    playing it as much as we enjoyed making it!


    The full game will be released
    soon, with the rest of the story, lots of historic fun, political intrigue, and
    so much betrayal.


    Feel free to join our Discord and interact with the community
    or share your feedback with us. Don''t forget to wishlist the game on Steam and
    follow us on social media.


    Sincerely,

    Witz Games Team

'
